<title>HONG KONG: CLP unit signs JV for Shandong plants.</title>
<headline>CLP unit signs JV for Shandong plants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd said on Friday its unit China Energy Investment Co Ltd had signed a contract to jointly develop power plants with a total installed capacity of 3,000 megawatts (MW) in China's Shandong province.</p>
</text>
